{"code":"002600","name":"조흥","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"식품","sector_desc":"가공식품 제조. 경기 방어적이며 원재료(곡물) 가격과 해외 판매 확대가 실적 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1959년 조흥화학공업(주)로 설립되어 기초화학물 제조 판매를 시작하였으며, 현재는 식품 및 식품첨가물 제조업을 영위하고 있음. 종속회사로 2010년 설립된 조흥지에프를 보유하고 있으며, 모짜렐라 치즈 및 기타 치즈 제조업을 영위하고 있음. 주요 사업은 치즈류와 식품 및 식품첨가물류로 구성되어 있으며, 치즈류가 매출의 60.5%, 식품 및 식품첨가물류가 39.5%를 차지하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":139500.0,"open":139500.0,"high":139500.0,"low":139500.0,"volume":10,"amount":1395000.0,"ret_1d":0.0717,"gap":0.0717,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0717,"ret_20":1.3072,"ret_60":0.722,"ret_120":-4.9728,"ret_250":-9.0613,"ma20":138495.0,"ma60":137505.0,"ma120":139114.1667,"ma200":144946.5,"close_vs_ma200":-3.7576,"close_vs_ma60":1.4509,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":10.9785,"r2_60":0.4806,"slope_120":-9.0276,"r2_120":0.3419,"slope_250":-15.3036,"r2_250":0.6998,"high52":164400.0,"low52":132300.0,"pos_52w":22.4299,"dd_52w":-15.146,"mdd_1y":-17.0476,"atr14_pct":0.8397,"vol_ann_60":11.4124,"vol_avg20":13.65,"vol_ratio20":0.7326,"vr5":0.9098,"vr20":0.108,"amount_avg5":2648800.0,"amount_avg20":1890410.0,"amount_avg60":2967108.3333,"obv_chg20":-9.1575,"turnover_20":0.0455,"pv_eff_20":28.7294,"rsi14":57.1625,"frgn_net_5":-5.0,"inst_net_5":-1.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0008,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0002,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.001,"frgn_net_20":-9.0,"inst_net_20":-2.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0015,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0003,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0018,"frgn_net_60":-44.0,"inst_net_60":-4.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0073,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0007,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.008,"frgn_net_120":18.0,"inst_net_120":-202.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.003,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0337,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.0307,"foreign_ratio":0.04,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.02,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":56.0,"op_margin_q":4.4374,"op_qoq":47.3684,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":40.0,"rev_yoy":3.1889,"op_trend_4q":-5.3202,"fin_period":"202606","roe":1.49,"debt_ratio":238.76,"per":38.11,"pbr":0.57,"div_yield":4.3,"foreign_rate":